<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Spicers yr net profit slides 35 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Spicers yr net profit slides 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    25.12 vs 37.88</p>
<p>    Net				     16.02 vs 24.61</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		5.5 vs 6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Paper merchant Spicers Paper Ltd is a 46 percent owned by Amcor Ltd.  </p>
