<p>    Tax					9.10 vs 13.26</p>
<p>    Interest				16.47 vs 13.42</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  11.69 vs 11.84</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs 0.01</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
